      "side": 1,
      "message": "It fixes a bug at transition from RO to RW when using a BMA422 acceleromter: the accelerometer was reinitialized, but the ODR was left to an older value and was not yet [re]set to a default value. The motion sense task would try to read the sensor, but we would hit an assert since for the sensor PoV the ODR was 0 and no read should be attempted.",
